diff -ruN phase21_green/PLANNING_VECTOR_EXTRACTION.md phase22_work/PLANNING_VECTOR_EXTRACTION.md
--- phase21_green/PLANNING_VECTOR_EXTRACTION.md	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
+++ phase22_work/PLANNING_VECTOR_EXTRACTION.md	2026-08-05 21:58:37.261987068 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# Planning drawing vector extraction
+
+Phase 22 converts accepted georeferenced **vector PDF** drawings into evidence-only GeoJSON candidates. It does not modify the world directly.
+
+## Inputs
+
+Only drawings accepted by Phase 21 with an affine page-to-EPSG:27700 transform and RMSE within the configured limit are processed. Raster scans, unlocated plans, refused applications, page frames and sub-threshold geometry remain withheld.
+
+## Outputs
+
+- `planning-vector-extraction.json`: counts, policy, per-document decisions and warnings.
+- `planning-vector-candidates.geojson`: paths, ride centrelines, footprints, landscape polygons, drainage lines and other candidates.
+
+Each feature records application/document provenance, extraction method, georeference RMSE, geometry role, confidence and `world_eligible: false`. Phase 23 must pass these candidates through planning-authority status, licence, confidence, overlap, offset and ambiguity gates before any OSM repair.
